{
  "id": "lww-settings-suspend-bury-word-status",
  "title": "Whole-value last-writer-wins registers",
  "covers": [
    "spec: settings - last writer wins per field",
    "spec: Suspend, bury, word status - last writer wins",
    "confusable: a user decision beats a suggestion whatever the clocks"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "settings: A sets new_per_day = 15 (T+40), B sets 25 (T+41): 25 wins. B resets leech_threshold with null: the row stays with value null.",
    "suspend: A suspends (T+50), B unsuspends (T+51): not suspended.",
    "bury: A buries (T+52); B's unbury is older (T+49) and loses: still buried.",
    "word status: A sets known (T+60), B sets blacklisted (T+61), A clears (T+62): the clear wins; the row stays with override_status null so older sets cannot come back.",
    "confusable: the user rejected the pair at T+63; the server's suggestion has a later clock (T+100) but a suggestion never beats a user decision."
  ],
